 in time — the main reason people book a driver by the hour."}]]}],["$","div","Evenings & weekends",{"className":"bg-white p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-heading text-sm font-bold tabular-nums text-[#16A34A]","children":"03"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 font-heading text-base font-bold","children":"Evenings & weekends"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#4B5563]","children":"Riyadh's leisure traffic runs late. Diriyah dinners, malls and the Boulevard zones in Hittin get busiest after sunset and on Thursday and Friday nights — book a fixed return time instead of searching for a car at closing."}]]}],["$","div","Event periods",{"className":"bg-white p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-heading text-sm font-bold tabular-nums text-[#16A34A]","children":"04"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 font-heading text-base font-bold","children":"Event periods"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#4B5563]","children":"Large exhibitions and Riyadh Season nights concentrate thousands of arrivals at one venue. Allow extra time and agree a specific pickup point in advance — venue drop-off lanes change with each event."}]]}],["$","div","Ramadan",{"className":"bg-white p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-heading text-sm font-bold tabular-nums text-[#16A34A]","children":"05"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 font-heading text-base font-bold","children":"Ramadan"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#4B5563]","children":"Daytime roads are quieter; traffic peaks around iftar and late into the night. Tell us if your trip falls in Ramadan and we plan the pickup time accordingly."}]]}],["$","div","Long-distance trips",{"className":"bg-white p-6","children":["$L53","$L54","$L55"]}]]}]]}]
