55:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#4B5563]","children":"Intercity drives from Riyadh are long — Dammam is the shortest major corridor. Early starts beat the city traffic out; the driver stops for prayer, fuel and rest on request."}]
